{c: Chords: the writer's own chart}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[E]Open my eyes, help [A]me see, open [E]my eyes, help me [A]see
[G#m]All [A]of the [G#m]things, the [A]beautiful things You have planned for [E]me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[E]Open up my heart, show [A]me love, open up [E]my heart, show me [A]love
[G#m]Pure [A] [G#m]innocence, calm [A]gentleness like the beautiful [E]dove
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E]Gonna need You beside me, I wanna feel Your love surround
[A]Gonna need You to guide me, I wanna hold Your hand through the up and downs
[E]Gonna need You beside me, I wanna feel Your love surround
[A]Gonna need You to guide me, I wanna hold Your hand through the up and downs
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[E]Open up my eyes, [A]help me see, open [E]up my eyes, help me [A]see
[G#m]All of [A]the [G#m]things, the [A]beautiful things You have planned for [E]me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
[E]Gonna need You beside me, I wanna feel Your love surround
[E]Gonna need You to guide me, I wanna hold Your hand through the up and downs
[E]Gonna need You beside me, I wanna feel Your love surround
[E]Gonna need You to guide me, I wanna hold Your hand through the up and downs
{end_of_chorus}
